{"kind":"html","caption":"把一次跳跃能覆盖的下标视为一层，在扫描当前层时，持续计算下一层最远能到达的位置。扫描到当前层边界后，才确定必须增加一次跳跃，并把边界推进到已发现的最远位置。示例中第一层扫描下标 0 得到边界 2，第二层扫描下标 1、2 得到边界 4，因此最少跳跃 2 次。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>跳跃游戏 II 可视化</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  main{ max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px 10px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .intro { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n  .panel { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; }\n  .panel-title { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .array { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }\n  .cell { width: 38px; min-height: 48px; padding: 4px 2px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #252526; text-align: center; transition: .35s; }\n  .value, .metric-value { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .index { color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; margin-top: 2px; }\n  .tag { min-height: 12px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .cell.active { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; }\n  .cell.range { background: #173b52; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .cell.reached { background: #0e639c; border-color: #6cb6ff; }\n  .metrics { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .metric { padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; background: #1c1c1c; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; }\n  .metric-label { color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .metric-value { color: #3794ff; font-size: 13px; }\n  .explain { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border-left: 3px solid #3794ff; background: #252526; font-size: 12px; }\n  .layers { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }\n  .layer { flex: 1 1 120px; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; background: #252526; font-size: 12px; }\n  .layer.on { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .layer-name { margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .mono { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .progress { height: 3px; margin-top: 8px; border-radius: 3px; background: #3c3c3c; }\n  .progress-bar { width: 0; height: 100%; border-radius: 3px; background: #3794ff; }\n  @media (max-width: 520px) { .metrics { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>跳跃游戏 II：按层扩展最远边界</h1>\n  <p class=\"intro\">示例：<span class=\"mono\">nums = [2, 3, 1, 1, 4]</span>。高亮格表示当前扫描位置，蓝色范围表示本轮能够覆盖的下标。</p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">数组与扫描过程</div>\n    <div class=\"array\" id=\"array\"></div>\n    <div class=\"explain\" id=\"explain\"></div>\n    <div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"progress-bar\" id=\"progress\"></div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">贪心变量</div>\n    <div class=\"metrics\">\n      <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">已确定的跳跃次数 jumps</div><div class=\"metric-value\" id=\"jumps\">0</div></div>\n      <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">当前层边界 currentEnd</div><div class=\"metric-value\" id=\"end\">0</div></div>\n      <div class=\"metric\"><div class=\"metric-label\">下一层最远位置 farthest</div><div class=\"metric-value\" id=\"far\">0</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">跳跃层次</div>\n    <div class=\"layers\">\n      <div class=\"layer\" id=\"layer0\"><div class=\"layer-name\">起点</div><div class=\"mono\">{0}</div></div>\n      <div class=\"layer\" id=\"layer1\"><div class=\"layer-name\">跳 1 次可达</div><div class=\"mono\">{1, 2}</div></div>\n      <div class=\"layer\" id=\"layer2\"><div class=\"layer-name\">跳 2 次可达</div><div class=\"mono\">{3, 4}</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n  const nums = [2, 3, 1, 1, 4];\n  const array = document.getElementById('array');\n  nums.forEach((value, index) => {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'cell';\n    cell.innerHTML = '<div class=\"value\">' + value + '</div><div class=\"index\">下标 ' + index + '</div><div class=\"tag\" id=\"tag' + index + '\"></div>';\n    array.appendChild(cell);\n  });\n  const cells = [...document.querySelectorAll('.cell')];\n  const tags = nums.map((_, i) => document.getElementById('tag' + i));\n  const jumps = document.getElementById('jumps');\n  const end = document.getElementById('end');\n  const far = document.getElementById('far');\n  const explain = document.getElementById('explain');\n  const progress = document.getElementById('progress');\n  const layers = [0,1,2].map(i => document.getElementById('layer' + i));\n\n  const steps = [\n    { active: 0, range: [0], tags: ['起点','','','',''], jumps: 0, end: 0, far: 0, layer: 0, text: '从下标 0 开始。currentEnd = 0，表示当前这一跳尚未覆盖其他位置。' },\n    { active: 0, range: [0,1,2], tags: ['扫描 i','下一层','下一层','',''], jumps: 0, end: 0, far: 2, layer: 0, text: '扫描下标 0：i + nums[i] = 0 + 2 = 2，因此 farthest 更新为 2。' },\n    { active: -1, range: [1,2], tags: ['边界结算','第 1 层','第 1 层','',''], jumps: 1, end: 2, far: 2, layer: 1, text: '扫描到 currentEnd，说明当前层结束。跳跃次数加 1，并把新边界推进到 2。' },\n    { active: 1, range: [1,2,3,4], tags: ['','扫描 i','当前层','下一层','下一层'], jumps: 1, end: 2, far: 4, layer: 1, text: '扫描下标 1：1 + nums[1] = 4，下一层最远已经可以覆盖终点。' },\n    { active: 2, range: [1,2,3,4], tags: ['','','扫描 i','下一层','终点'], jumps: 1, end: 2, far: 4, layer: 1, text: '继续扫描当前层的下标 2，最远位置仍为 4。扫描完整层后才能确定最少跳数。' },\n    { active: -1, range: [3,4], tags: ['','','边界结算','第 2 层','到达终点'], jumps: 2, end: 4, far: 4, layer: 2, text: '再次到达层边界，跳跃次数加 1，currentEnd 推进到 4。终点已被覆盖，答案是 2。' }\n  ];\n\n  let stepIndex = 0;\n  function render(step) {\n    cells.forEach((cell, i) => {\n      cell.className = 'cell';\n      if (step.range.includes(i)) cell.classList.add('range');\n      if (i === step.active) cell.classList.add('active');\n      if (step.layer === 2 && i === 4) cell.classList.add('reached');\n      tags[i].textContent = step.tags[i];\n    });\n    jumps.textContent = step.jumps;\n    end.textContent = step.end;\n    far.textContent = step.far;\n    explain.textContent = step.text;\n    layers.forEach((layer, i) => layer.classList.toggle('on', i === step.layer));\n    progress.style.transition = 'none';\n    progress.style.width = '0%';\n    requestAnimationFrame(() => requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n      progress.style.transition = 'width 1.8s linear';\n      progress.style.width = '100%';\n    }));\n  }\n  function next() {\n    render(steps[stepIndex]);\n    stepIndex = (stepIndex + 1) % steps.length;\n  }\n  next();\n  setInterval(next, 2000);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
